# behavior.pdl - Declarative behavior model for Fuzzball
# Book:Page / Events Architecture (hybrid with relay event bus)
# 
# This file declares the pet's available behaviors as METHOD mappings.
# Each method maps to an .asm script that reads from the relay event bus
# and dispatches to the corresponding fuzzpet_action.+x op.
#
# The relay pattern (fuzzpet_brain.c -> interact_relay.txt) feeds the
# brain_dispatch.asm loop, which reads PET_ACTION rows and jumps to
# the appropriate handler script.

SECTION      | KEY            | VALUE
-------------|----------------|------------------------------------------
META         | piece_id       | fuzzball
META         | version        | 1.0
META         | type           | digital_pet

STATE        | name           | Fuzzball
STATE        | level          | 1
STATE        | state_file     | pieces/apps/fuzzpet_app/fuzzpet/state.txt
STATE        | relay_file     | pieces/apps/player_app/interact_relay.txt

# Behavior methods — each maps to an .asm event script
METHOD       | dispatch       | pieces/apps/fuzzpet_app/fuzzpet/scripts/brain_dispatch.asm
METHOD       | feed           | pieces/apps/fuzzpet_app/fuzzpet/scripts/pet_feed.asm
METHOD       | play           | pieces/apps/fuzzpet_app/fuzzpet/scripts/pet_play.asm
METHOD       | sleep          | pieces/apps/fuzzpet_app/fuzzpet/scripts/pet_sleep.asm
METHOD       | explore        | pieces/apps/fuzzpet_app/fuzzpet/scripts/pet_explore.asm
METHOD       | heal           | pieces/apps/fuzzpet_app/fuzzpet/scripts/pet_heal.asm
METHOD       | evolve         | pieces/apps/fuzzpet_app/fuzzpet/scripts/pet_evolve.asm
METHOD       | toggle_emoji   | pieces/apps/fuzzpet_app/fuzzpet/scripts/pet_toggle_emoji.asm

# Need-based guardrails (read by fuzzpet_brain.c fallback policy)
GUARDRAIL    | hunger_critical | 60
GUARDRAIL    | happiness_low   | 20
GUARDRAIL    | energy_low      | 20

RESPONSE     | default        | *purrr*
